    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That works for the standard stuff. But we're also looking at how to increase \"customer rapport\" across different demographics. We've noticed that for some of our customers in more urban or inner-city areas, that super formal corporate tone can feel a bit cold or out of touch. \n\nCould you give me an alternative version of that response? Maybe something more casual and \"urban-friendly\" that sounds less like a robot and more like someone they'd actually vibe with? Just something that feels more authentic to that specific community.",
